y wanted his other  franchisees to be better and dan makes a  habit of trying to connect people even  if has nothing to do with his business  just trying to connect people  because he realizes first that it makes  him feel good right it makes the other  person feel feels good and then it also  it helps your business if you're  spending your time helping people you're  going to stay top of mind and they're  going to look for ways to help you out  as well so then thank you so much thank  you for being a fan thank you be for  being a friend thank you for picking me  up from the airport thank you for  recommending me to the event i had a  blast meeting you and for those of you  watching i hope you'll take some time  this week to thank somebody who's had an  impact in your business somehow  and make them feel  special  believe for those of you watching like  the video consider supporting me by  clicking the link in the description  leave a comment let me know what you  think and click on my face to subscribe  to the channel thank you so much i'll  see you soon  you
 

